# --- Lead annotations (2026-11-16, evidence, not device output) ---
# DRAM (boot0, authoritative for V4.0): LPDDR4 (type 8), 672 MHz, 32-bit,
# 1 rank, 1024 MB, VCC 1100 mV. Matches our SPL defconfig exactly
# (CONFIG_SUNXI_DRAM_H616_LPDDR4, DRAM_CLK=672, DCDC3=1100).
# Trained TPRs this boot: tpr6=0x3e808080, tpr11=0x1c201f1b,
# tpr12=0x06060606/0x05050605, tpr13=2008c60. Ours: 0x40808080,
# 0x1b1f1e1c, 0x06060606 — same neighborhood (per-boot training
# variance); exact match NOT required since U-Boot trains at boot too.
# Panel: lcd_panel_uboot_fj035fhd05_v1_init confirms fog_fj035fhd05_v1.
# allen_boe_lcd=0/str=old hints a panel variant scheme (old vs BOE?).
# RTC: pcf8563 low-voltage => no RTC battery (explains wrong clock).
# mmcblk1p1 FAT corrupt -> forced read-only: second SD card needs
# fsck/reformat; do not trust it for transfers until fixed.
# Benign stock noise (ignore when diffing our boot): Reserve0/bootloader/
# private partno errors, secure-storage magic errors, NAND node, HDMI DDC,
# cpu opp debugfs, VE debug, cgroup2/hidepid/binfmt (4.9 vs new systemd),
# i2c supply + wlan gpio fails (Wi-Fi works regardless), sdc1 RTO probe.
